source: crates/easyplay/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Export a game's settings as TOML

Usage: easyplay export [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
  -o, --output <FILE>  Output file (default: the exports folder)
  -v, --verbose...     Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help           Print help
